window.products.push({"id":434024,"name":"Vandesun Dual Layer Grommet Top Mix and Match Blackout Curtains with White Sheer for Living Room and Bedroom - 1 Panel (52 X 63, Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H3-vVq0bL._AC_SL1034_.jpg","description":"[SIZE/PACKAGE]: 1 panels per package, each curtain panel measures 52 inch Wide x 63 inch Long. Each curtain panel includes eight (8) mute grommets, which can fit up to 1.65 inch rod. No noise when sliding. A Vandesun specially designed flower tieback is also included. [UNIQUE DESIGN]: Double-layer, mix and match stylish design, soft and elegant, creates a romantic atmosphere. Behind of the elegant crinkled white sheer is an innovative triple weave fabric cloth, which blocks out sunlight and UV-rays, and also give you an elegant and light experience. The eye-catching flower tieback design is very unique, and you will not find same products on the market. [GREAT FUNCTION]: This light pink or blue window curtains with white sheers are perfectly for bedroom, kid’s room or baby room. You can let light fly through your white lace alone or layer it with the blackout curtain to obstruct light while adding style and privacy. It is also a great decoration for any styles of home. [AMAZING MATERIAL]: Made of 100% modern fabric without any chemical coating or coloring, safe for you and your family. The material is heavy and soft, blocks 85% of light. It also features thermal insulation, noise reducing, fade-resistance and energy efficiency. [EASY CARE & SATISFACTION GUARANTEED]: This high quality curtain sheer is very easy for cleaning, machine washable to allow for quick and effortless home care, use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Low temperature ironing. Vandesun’s curtain features Amazon 30 days return policy! 100% satisfaction guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61H3-vVq0bL._AC_SL1034_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vandesun","source_asin":"B07DN7ZQXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DN7ZQXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DN7ZQXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
