window.products.push({"id":434222,"name":"Deitybless Side By Side or Miles Apart Friends Are Always Close at Heart - Best Friend Birthday Gifts for Women, Girlfriend, Coworker, Long Distance F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PxHAuXRpL._AC_SL1476_.jpg","description":"Deitybless pack wine tumbler cup with lids 12 oz double wall vacuum stemless insulated wine glasses, durable insulated coffee mug for wine, cocktail, champagne, beer, water. Features: They can dishwasher and won't get scratched like glass or plastic, just rinse and wipe dry to remove water spots, make them shine instead of endless polishing like with glass. Good insulation wine cup: The stemless wine glasses with insulated double-wall technology to keep hot and cold longer, the advanced structure keeps drinks cold for more than 7 hours and hot more than 3 hours. More other uses: This wine glass set can be as champagne flute, coffee mugs or water tumblers for hiking, picnics, cars, outdoor, poolside, barbecues or everyday beverage needs. Widely application: Nice appearance drink-ware set is suitable for wine, coffee, water, champagne, beer as bar supplies or household, these beautiful stainless steel wine glasses also can be applied as good gifts for wedding parties, birthday presents or business gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PxHAuXRpL._AC_SL1476_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deitybless","source_asin":"B083M87HLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083M87HLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083M87HLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":434223,"name":"Ollygrin Coffee Bean Burr Mill Grinder, Coffee Bean Burr Grinder Electric, Automatic Conical Burr Coffee Grinder With 30 Adjustable Grind Settings For","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y1YXWLytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable Conical Burr: With 40-millimeter stainless steel conical burrs, OLLYGRIN burr coffee grinder ensure optimal flavor extraction and create uniform grounds. The coffee grinder is designed with a double safety protection,1.Friction clutch prevents damage to the grinding gear of burr grinder in the event of small stones in your beans. 2.Built-in overheating protection protects the motor of burr grinder to ensure the coffee grinder a long life; Optimal Flavor with 30 Precise Settings: OLLYGRIN burr coffee grinder has a gear reduction motor, which generates the slow grinding action. The coffee grinder produces less heat from friction and ensures the flavor and aroma of the coffee beans intact.The OLLYGRIN burr coffee grinder offers 30 precise grind settings to make everything from an ultra-fine grind for espresso to a coarser grind for french press coffee for your customized brewing method; Large Capacity & Auto-locking System: OLLYGRIN burr coffee grinder has a large hopper,so our burr grinder is capable of holding 10 ounces of whole beans, the OLLYGRIN coffee grinder allows to store enough beans for several servings of coffee. The coffee grinder has a auto-locking system, the coffee hopper on burr grinder can resist the beans from spilling out for easy removal, storage, and transfer of the bean hopper; One Button Simple Operation: OLLYGRIN burr coffee grinder is easy to operate.The unique rotary button two-in-one one-button design in coffee grinder makes the grinding process very simple and interesting. The adjustable 2-12 cup settings of coffee grinder is good for single cup for one or a large gathering; Easy to Clean: The upper burr lift-off option and included brush allows you to clean the burr coffee grinder with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Y1YXWLytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ollygrin","source_asin":"B0BVZXGRGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVZXGRGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVZXGRGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
