window.products.push({"id":434412,"name":"MUUEGM Gel Memory Foam Pillows, Contour Pillows for Neck and Shoulder Pain, Ergonomic Orthopedic Sleeping Neck Contoured Support Pillow for Side Sleep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YVCT7KwSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MEMORY FOAM GEL PILLOW】: This sleeping pillow is made of IPA-certified high-quality gel memory foam, which proves that the memory foam core does not use any harmful substances and provides superior pressure relief and comfort. The bed pillow is equipped with a detachable washable pillowcase certified by OEKO-TEK, which is skin-friendly, ensuring your safety and health. 【GEL COOLING BED PILLOW FALLA ASLEEP FASTER】: Experiments have shown that cooling the head by 1-2 degrees Celsius helps to fall asleep faster and reduce the pain caused by insomnia. The gel bed pillow can ensure that your head temperature is 2 degrees Celsius lower than your body temperature, allowing you to fall asleep faster, and really keep you cool and bid farewell to the sweaty night. You will enjoy a peaceful night! 【FULL SUPPORT & ALLEVIATE COMMON SLEEPING PROBLEM】: Memory foam is designed to contour to the unique shape of your body.The soft cervical neck support pillow can give enough support to your head and neck, whether a side sleeper, back and stomach sleeper, ease pain, reduce snoring and the number of flips while sleeping, you will feel a new level of comfort, fall asleep faster and deeper. At the same time, this breathable supportive neck pillow can be used on both sides. 【NON-TEMPERATURE-SENSITIVE MEMORY FOAM PATENTS】: We have patents in US and other countries. Ordinary memory foam will become harder in winter and will be uncomfortable, and it will become softer in summer and lose its function of supporting the neck. Our memory foam stays the same throughout the year, staying soft and supportive.The memory foam pillow will be a great gift for christmas, birthdays, valentine's day, mother's day, father's day, weddings, graduations. 【Perfect Health Care & Christmas Gift】: The neck sleeping pillows achieve just the right balance between support and comfort. It's designed to fit the natural physiological curvature perfectly, reduces your head, neck and back pain, alleviates shoulder stiffness, help the cervical spine stretch and relax. Our cervical pillow is very suitable for the elders, officers, students, IT, and those who suffer from sleep issues. Perfect careful gift to your concerned people.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YVCT7KwSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUUEGM","source_asin":"B0C66F8M1X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C66F8M1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C66F8M1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
