window.products.push({"id":434418,"name":"3 Gallon Better Bottle - 2 PACK","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AX-s8sitL._AC_.jpg","description":"3 Gallon Better Bottle Fermentation Carboys (this listing is for 2 carboys) Better Bottles are specially formulated with to meet the Home Brewers specific needs. The carboys: - Are designed to be scuff-resistant, practically unbreakable and easy to handle - Taste and Odor Free - BPA, DEHP, and Plasticizer Free - Impermeable to Oxygen - Easy to wash and sanitize (no brush necessary) - Non-absorbing, non-porous, and non-wetting (hydrophobic) so it will not carry/transmit flavors and odors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AX-s8sitL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Bottle","source_asin":"B00INBPZIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00INBPZIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00INBPZIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":434419,"name":"Humidifier Cleaner, Universal Humidifier Tank Cleaner Fish for Most Humidifier & Fish Tank, Purifies Water, Eliminates White Dust and Odor, Prevents H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThwGBUlPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your Humidifier Clean - The humidifier cleaning fish has excellent cleaning performance, prolongs the life of the humidifier filter and keeps the water clean. The humidifier cleaner can prevent other odors by improving the water quality of the humidifier. Cute Floating Shark - The humidifier tank cleaner looks cute and floats in the fish tank and humidifier. At the same time, this humidifier fish can reduce tank cleaning time and improving the water quality. Easy to Use & Replacement - The size of humidifier tank cleaning fish is 3.9 x 1.2 x 0.98 inches, just put in the humidifier tank(the opening should be at least 1.3in/3.5cm in diameter), it will float in the fish tank, and the center of gravity can be adjusted by slight shaking to make it show different floating shapes. Compatible with Most Humidifiers - The humidifier clean fish can be used with evaporator, warm and cold mist humidifiers, steamers and fish tanks, and the humidifier clean fish also works with humidifier wicking filters. One Cleaning Shark is effective for up to two gallons of tank capacity. However, we recommend using 2 fish per tank and changing it every 30 days. Great Value Package & Good Customer Service - There are 6 cleaner sharks in the package. Not only are they great for cleaning humidifier fish tanks, they're also great for giving gifts. If you have any questions about the humidifier cleaner shark, please contact us and we will solve the issue within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ThwGBUlPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FITORCH","source_asin":"B0BGQ465RW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGQ465RW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGQ465RW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":434420,"name":"Purple Handcrafted Small 4 Inch Fused Glass Trinket Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bnXltglBL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a small 4 inch square, 7mm thick fused glass decorative trinket dish with a beautiful ultra-violet transparent base accented by an abstract design in complementary neutral shades of purple, lavender, cream, gray and white. It is a stunning trinket dish that could be used as a ring dish, small dip dish, olive dish, tea bag dish, snack bowl. Would make a beautiful birthday gift or business gift. Would make a nice gift for Autism Awareness, Parkinson's disease or Pancreatic Cancer Awareness. This is an original one-of-a-kind design. Purple glass is one of the most expensive glasses produced. This dish, while small, requires a lot of extra firings and design hours to make; thus, the price is a little higher. As with any fine glass, it is not microwave or oven safe. Sits flat on surface. Comes gift wrapped in a navy blue box with boutique-style tissue and turquoise ribbon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bnXltglBL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Faye Liston Fine Art Glass","source_asin":"B07C122J62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C122J62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C122J62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
