window.products.push({"id":434439,"name":"Gorgeoos Set of 2 Warm White Birch Tree Light with Battery or USB Powered 24 LED Detachable Tabletop Tree Light Jewelry Holder Decor for Home Party Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71REEzg2MJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄【Light Up Birch Trees】Gorgeoos Birch Tree Light is a well-designed and handcrafted artwork, bonsai tree-shaped LED lights covered with birch bark texture, artificial but lifelike. Bring snowy winters indoors with this rustic LED birch tree. 🎄【Process upgrade】Understanding the needs of many customers for LED maple tree lights, our professional technical team has optimized the design of the battery box. The switch is above the battery compartment for added convenience, and the optimized handling of the power supply connection greatly reduces the risk of LED failure and unexpected power surges. 🎄【Flexible Branches】Adjustable branches meet DIY needs and are made of wire, plastic and iron. You can bend branches and trees into any shape or more natural tree shape as needed. You can also add any creative ideas to the tree, such as hearts, five-pointed stars, cards, money, snowflakes, spiders, easter eggs, jewelry, greenery, etc., to create your own tree lights. 🎄【USB or Battery Powered】Only need USB or 3 AA batteries (not included) to light up the desk light, there are 24 warm white LEDS in total, the total height is 23.6 inches, and the base is 4 inches X 4 inches. Features a stable opening pattern and long lifespan with less power, minimizing the risk of overheating. 🎄【Multifunctional】The LED illuminated birch tree is suitable for any indoor or outdoor decoration, the lovely modern design is perfect for home, wedding, party, shopping window, fireplace, bedroom and living room; the sturdy metal base can also stand stably as a Christmas tree. You can use it not only for Christmas, but also for Easter, Valentine's Day and parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71REEzg2MJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorgeoos","source_asin":"B0BCVDVR3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCVDVR3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCVDVR3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
