window.products.push({"id":434456,"name":"CDNSE Drink Organizer for Fridge,Spring Loaded Soda Can Organizer,Width-adjustable Push Rod Slide Rail Drink Dispenser for Fridge,Black（12.2in-5）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vKgixxefL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Size】（12.2in-5）,12.2in indicates depth,5=5push rod rails. （14.96in-5）,14.96in indicates depth,5=5push rod rails. （14.96in-6）,14.96in indicates depth,6=6push rod rails. You can choose the most suitable pop can organizer according to the size of the refrigerator or cabinet in your home. 【Large capacity】The width between the two partitions of the fridge can organizer is freely adjustable, which makes the soda can dispenser fit most standard sized beverage bottles and cans (12 oz, 16 oz, 16.9 oz, 20 oz, etc.).Each track of 12.2in/14.96in deep refrigerator drink organizer can hold about 4/5 bottles or jars. 【Unique Features】The refrigerator can storage is composed of spring push rods, taxiway and galvanized iron dividers. The refrigerator soda can holder has a slide-out feature, which means you don't have to reach for beverages from deep inside the frigde with difficulty.When the first beverage placed on the fridge soda dispenser is removed, the beverages behind will automatically be pushed forward for easy access. 【Versatile】This refrigerator drink dispenser can be used to push a variety of bottled and canned beverages such as cola, soda, beer, sparkling wine and more. The refrigerator soda holder can be widely used in refrigerators, kitchen counters, convenience stores or vending machines, etc. With this beverage can holder, your beverages at home will be organized and clutter free. 【Easy to assemble and clean】This spring loaded beverage dispenser for fridger is very easy to assemble without any tools, you can install it freehand in a few minutes according to the instructions provided. And the waterproof material of the refrigerator pop can organizer makes the surface very smooth and easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vKgixxefL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CNDSE","source_asin":"B0B81X3CFD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B81X3CFD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B81X3CFD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
