window.products.push({"id":434548,"name":"Croscill Plateau Comforter Set, King, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Xji7Ie4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by nature’s incredible phenomenon of sedimentary layering, Croscill’s Plateau collection is most certainly one of a kind. Plateau’s chenille comforter and shams feature jewel toned stripes set upon a rich olive ground, mimicking the multi-toned layers typical of Southwestern Plateaus. Take a closer look and you’ll notice intricate diamond detailing within the chenille stripes. Distressed leather European shams and bed skirt compliment the color palette nicely while adding some relief from the stripe. The distressed leather fashion pillow features an oversized moose motif. The distressed leather fashion pillow features an embroidered sundial motif. The distressed leather fashion pillow features a striped chenille portion and three horn buttons with faux leather tassels. There are three distressed leather fashion pillows available for this collection: one featuring an oversized moose motif; one featuring an embroidered sundial motif; and one featuring a striped chenille portion with three horned buttons and faux leather tassels. The square pillow is full chenille, coordinating back to the stripe of the comforter and shams. Studs of tarnished gold adorn the boudoir pillow, which contributes a distinctive Southwestern flare to the ensemble. Complete the collection with coordinating window treatments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1Xji7Ie4eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Croscill","source_asin":"B005JXE2FW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005JXE2FW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005JXE2FW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
