window.products.push({"id":434650,"name":"The Star Tarot Card Tapestry (Black & White) - Spooky Siren Mermaid - Gothic Halloween Home Decor Wall Hanging (59\" x 51\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8102T0hUoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Star Tarot Card Tapestry The Star depicts the image of a beautifully haunting siren sitting on a rock along the shore. In her left hand, she holds a jug, which represents the subconscious mind. The water from this jug runs along the ground in five distinct rivulets. These represent the five senses. In her left hand, the siren holds another jug that she is pouring into the sea. This represents the conscious mind. She pours this water into the sea in order to cleanse and nurture her environment. The siren is made in part from the land and in part from the sea. Her human form represents her connection to the land. This symbolizes her practical abilities and reasoning. Her siren tail represents her connection to the water. This symbolizes the ability to call upon her intuition for guidance while honoring her emotions. The largest star in the sky represents her core essence while the seven sea-stars in her hair represent her chakras. In the sky behind her, we see a raven flying towards the largest star. The raven is a symbol of wisdom and mystery. By its movement toward the star, it represents the siren’s devotion toward self-understanding and inward thought. Tapestry Features - Fine Line Detail & Intense Vivid Colors- Printed Top & Finished Edge- 100% lightweight polyester Washing and Drying Instructions - Cold Gentle Machine Wash - Line or Tumble Dry on Low- Don’t Bleach or Iron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8102T0hUoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Ghoulish Garb","source_asin":"B084B53PGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084B53PGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084B53PGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
