window.products.push({"id":434772,"name":"FUNGYAND Sushi Making Kit, All in One Sushi Bazooka Maker with Bamboo Mats, Bamboo Chopsticks, Avocado Slicer, Paddle, Spreader, Sushi Knife, Chopstic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816h4RknXrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL IN ONE SUSHI MAKING KIT - FUNGYAND sushi making kit provides everything you need for the complete sushi-making experience. Package include Sushi Bazooka, Bamboo Mat, Paddle, Spreader, Knife, Bamboo Chopsticks, Chopsticks Holder, Avocado Slicer. This kit has everything you need to make sushi in just a couple of minutes. This set comes ready to gift in a beautiful box, no wrapping paper necessary! GOOD MATERIALS AND SOUND WORKMANSHIP - This sushi making kit is made of premium bamboo and food grade plastic, 100% natural, BPA free. Safer and healthier for your family. The sushi bazooka easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Our sushi mats includes 1x white sushi mat and 1x green sushi mat, they are put together by 100% high-quality cotton threads, strong and durable. SAVE YOUR TIME AND MONEY- Tired of spending fortune in restaurants for your favorite sushi? Than this is the right sushi making kit for you! With this DIY sushi making kit you can prepare tasty sushi easily and fast at home, You and your children will remember the moments when you were making sushi together as a fun and productive pastime for years to come! The best gift for friends, family, wifes, etc. EASY TO USE - This sushi making kit is very easy to use. All you need is just open the sushi bazooka, “load” with rice and the other ingredients, close it and squeeze out the long tube with a nearly finished product. we have detailed manuals to show you how to use the bazooka and mats, and also come with instructions for ingredients for reference, designed for the beginner. FRIENDLY CUSTOMER SERVICE - We are very concerned about customer experience and we’re always ready to assist you，if for any reason, you are not satisfied with our sushi making kit, please let us know and we will solve it for you ASAP. Welcome to order and hope you enjoy the sweet time to make sushi! Thank you very much for your support!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816h4RknXrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FUNGYAND","source_asin":"B07HRR4L5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434772","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HRR4L5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HRR4L5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
