window.products.push({"id":434867,"name":"Statements2000 Set of 4 Handmade Black & Silver Metal Wall Art Accents by Jon Allen, 4 Squares Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WQijpos5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This eye catching wall accent, 4 Squares Black by Jon Allen, is the perfect complement for your contemporary, modern, or traditional home décor. Original metal artwork comes to life in natural light or under gallery / track lighting for dramatic effect. This is a four piece set of metal wall art. Each piece measures 12 in x 12 in. You can arrange this metal wall accent in a number of distinctive and attractive configurations. This mesmerizing wall décor will enhance any nook in your home with a sophisticated, elegant look. The art arrives ready to hang with pre-installed brackets for simple installation. The brackets \"float\" the artwork about 2 inches off the wall for added depth. The aluminum artwork is lighter than other metal artwork you may have handled before. Designed, created & packaged in our Florida-based Statements2000 studio. This original piece of artwork is signed by the artist and includes a certificate of authenticity. This three dimensional metal wall decor can be displayed in any room in your home. It looks terrific under natural light, and dazzles when featured under track lighting. This is an original handcrafted art piece. Jon’s love of all things abstract with influences like Chihuly are present in many of his compositions. You’ll also notice his love of clean, balanced, modern design and similar to elements of Frank Lloyd Wright’s architecture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WQijpos5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Statements2000","source_asin":"B077G3GRRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077G3GRRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077G3GRRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":434868,"name":"Loomie 8-Open Shelf Bookshelf with Cabinet, 76.77\" H Lux Etagere Bookcase, Tall Storage Display Modern Open Book Shelf, Metal Geometric Book Case for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iW2famkbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Staggered Ample Display & Storage Space】Loomie etagere bookcase with cabinet features eight staggered open shelves. Books, vases, candles, statuettes... All your prized possessions will instantly be showcased with this contemporary shelving unit. Besides, you will love how there is a cabinet on the bottom to hide some things. Its gold colour, authentic and refined makes no style faux pas. With its chic, minimalist look, this sleek and elegant Gold-Coloured Metal Shelving Unit adds classic beauty to any room while providing great storage, allowing you to living in the lap of luxury. 【Effortlessly Complement Any Aesthetic】Loomie Gold Bookcase with Cabinet is sleek and contemporary with quality construction. You’re going to love propping up your beloved items in style. With goldtone finished metal frame and white offset shelves, it creates a sophisticated, modern silhouette and dynamic display. Eight open staggered shelves at various angles create gorgeous negative space in your room and elevate any home-inspired space. you can have fun alternating storage and decorative elements. It will sit well in any scenes and Its size and minimalist design make it a possibility for all sorts of rooms. Hallway, corridor, living room, bedroom or office... You're spoilt for choice! 【Why Loomie Gold Bookshelf】Creates a refreshing update to your interior decoration match with this Loomie etagere bookcase. Pagoda-styling in an gold finish make this set an easy, subtle addition to your home, pairing perfectly with your modern home office or mid-century den. Its compact footprint makes this the perfect storage space for your space. The bottom cabinet provides ample hidden storage space for your personal items. While the upper geometric, staggered shelving creates plenty of open display and storage without weighing down the room visually. Ideal for you to create an eye-catching focal point in any space. 【High-caliber Quality & Sturdy Construction】This Loomie Gold Book Shelf with Cabinet is made from durable commercial grade laminate and metal frame that will withstand all the daily stress that is thrown at it through the years, ensuring a consistent chic, minimalist look. Loomie Gold Book Shelf is a safe purchase when it comes to quality. Anti-tipping kits and adjustable non-slip leg pads improve the stability. You don't worry about it falling by accident. Overall, it will get the storage or display job done and look good doing it. It's a perfect size gold bookshelf for every home space. 【Easy to assemble, Clear instruction】All parts and accessories are numbered, and each step of the installation has detailed instructions, easy to understand and to assemble. In addition, if you have any product problems, please contact us in time, all problems will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iW2famkbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loomie","source_asin":"B0C6MJLP3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6MJLP3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6MJLP3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
