window.products.push({"id":434985,"name":"Brewferm Buckrider Belgian Home Brewing Starter Brew Kit – Tripel Terror Craft Brew Mix – No Boil – Makes 9 Liters/ 2.5 Gallons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fm7EIAOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOMEBREW STARTER KIT - Start your own custom home brewing tradition. All the supplies you need to make beer, including a fermentation bucket and Belgian yeast, to enhance the complex flavor profiles. All you need to add is sugar, water, and bottles. BELGIAN RECIPE - Kit includes our golden, soft to the palate, strong and malty Tripel Terror premium brew. It is everything you want in a traditional ale. A slightly spiced finish, and a strong foam head makes this a truly enjoyable experience, and not just another brew. EASY TO USE - Brewferm makes homebrewing craft Belgian brew easy! Our premium craft brew kit is a no-boil kit as boiling is not necessary during preparation. The Tripel Terror mix makes 9 liters or 2.5 gallons of beer. FINEST INGREDIENTS - Brewferm Craft Brew Mix recipes are superbly crafted by our Belgian brewmasters using the finest quality ingredients, and renown Belgian beer brewing expertise. Brewferm kits are 100% natural, vegan, and non-GMO, and do not contain any artificial flavoring, coloring, or stabilizers. BREWING SUPPLIES - Brewferm Homebrewing Starter Kit includes: Tripel Terror Craft Brew Beer Mix, Buckrider Fermenting Bucket, Airlock, Bottling Tube, Liquid Crystal Thermometer, Check-it Bottling Hydrometer, Tap PVC with back nut, including 2 seals, Buckrider Super Wash, Carbonation Drops, 24 Brewferm Bottle Labels, and 6 Brewferm Coasters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Fm7EIAOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brewferm","source_asin":"B082P9S2HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082P9S2HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082P9S2HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":434986,"name":"Calphalon Commercial Nonstick 10-Inch Stir-Fry Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X2HFS64TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This versatile pan makes it easy to prepare delicious and healthy stir-fried and sautéed foods. The Calphalon Commercial Nonstick stir-fry pan has a diameter of 10-inches and a deep curved shape that allows food to be tossed and stirred without spilling, cooking food quickly and evenly. A long comfortable handle makes the pan easy to control, and the narrow base means that food can be stir-fried with the minimum of fat. Calphalon Commercial Nonstick cookware is constructed from thick, heavy-duty anodized aluminum for rapid heat transfer without hotspots. Interiors are coating with a durable 3-layer nonstick coating that allows healthy low-fat cooking. The securely riveted handles are made from cast stainless steel and shaped for comfort and to stay cool on the stovetop. Commercial Nonstick cookware is oven-safe to 450 degrees F, and should be hand washed. Every pan is covered by a limited lifetime warranty. Amazon.com Stretching 10 inches in diameter and shaped like a deep bowl, Calphalon's commercial nonstick stir fry pan functions similarly to a wok, but rests evenly on the burner without aid. Perfect for preparing a medley of chopped vegetables and cut meats, this versatile pan transitions comfortably from atop the stove to the oven for warming or re-heating. The excellent heat conductivity of heavy-gauge aluminum results in a rapidly heating pan while its nonstick interior surface requires less oil thus enabling low fat cooking. As with all nonstick surfaces, nylon, wood, or plastic utensils are favored over their metal counterparts. Secured by three rivets, the cast, stainless-steel handle stays cool with regular stove-top use and stretches 7 inches from the body to provide a firm grip for even transport. Washing in warm, sudsy water with a nylon scrub brush brings best results; dishwasher cleaning is not recommended. This item is oven-safe up to 450 degrees F and comes with Calphalon's lifetime warranty. -- Amy Arnold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X2HFS64TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B0000DDU9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DDU9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DDU9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
