window.products.push({"id":434994,"name":"Hillsdale Furniture Saddle Counter Stool, Rustic Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z+drq5c9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Rustic with a farmhouse flair, the Hillsdale Furniture Saddle Backless Counter Height Stool brings style and comfort to the modern saddle stool. The simple flared wood legs features a rustic gray finish that is perfectly complimented with a upholstered saddle seat. The saddle seat is upholstered in a weathered Taupe faux leather that is easy to clean, and perfectly padded for extra comfort. This unassuming classic saddle stool serves as excellent seating for your kitchen counter or counter height dining table, adding perfect comfort to you and your guests. Assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z+drq5c9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hillsdale","source_asin":"B09WBD9CM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WBD9CM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WBD9CM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":434995,"name":"Large Ice balls Trays and an ice tong, Ice Balls for Whiskey 2.5 Inch, Ice cube Tray with lid, Novel Round Ice Cube Mold for Cocktail, Coffee, No Side","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pfYh8k6NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Food grade material & Reusable ：Made of food-safe silicone material, this set of ice tray，including 6 ball ice cubes，are 100% BPA free and odorless, which ensures them safe and reusable to freeze liquids like beverages, soup, and even baby food. Easy to fill & Easy to clean ：Compared to ice mold that requires a funnel, you just need to fill the water up to the water level in one time, and cover the lid instead of filling the round ice cubes separately. This ice tray can be cleaned off quickly by hand and can also be washed in the dishwasher. Non-stick & Easy to pop out：Unlike the traditional hard plastic ice cube trays, the bottom of this silicone sphere ice cube tray is made of soft and flexible silicone material, which maintans the ice cube will not stick to the ball ice tray and makes it easy to be released by pushing the soft bottom. Well sealed & Removable lid : Unlike traditional ice tray，the removable lid of ice cube mold and the ice tray have a pretty good fit，ensuring ease of use and no side leakages. The reusable ice cube lid can overflow extra water and squeeze the air out so that ball ice cubes can be better formed. And the well sealed lid can keep the ice mold from other food odors in the refrigerator. In order to save more space for you，the ice trays with covers can be easily stacked in the refrigerator. Melt slowly & Perfect for drinks: Our big ice cube melts slowly, which enables it to cool your alcohol drinks fast without watering them down. Beautiful shape and large capacity ensures this set of silicone round ice cube trays is not limited to make ice, it is also perfect for making various of DIY ice food like cocktails, cordials, liqueur, whiskeys, ice tea, juices and suitable for making freezing sauces, baby food and even more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pfYh8k6NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIYLVF","source_asin":"B08VD84WZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-434995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VD84WZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VD84WZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
